<div class="sidebar">
  <h1>Artifact</h1>
  <hr>
  <h2>Creative Foundation, 2024</h2>
  <h3>Design, Open Source, Software &amp; Tools</h3>

  <p>Artifact is a non-profit that supports the development of design-focused
  open source software and tools from a community of creators. It provides
  hosting, tools, and technical advisory to its contributors and encourages
  explorations around productivity, entertainment, and digital art through web
  and mobile platforms.</p>

  <p>Works released through Artifact are supported open source contributions and
  shared infrastructure. The works that have lasting value to the broader world
  are supported indefinitely, with the community encouraged to connect and
  participate.</p>

